id: flash-input-keyhold
section: Flash
item: A key of the system keyboard, and an arrow of its joystick, stays down for the movie at least two frames, so a game that polls the keys each frame sees it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R6
wait text ready stage= 30
dtap 240 272
expect keyboard up
pause 1500
type-keys a
wait text keyup "keyup 65" 5
expect number keyheldms 60 2000
drag 702 757 760 757 350
wait text keyup "keyup 39" 5
expect number keyheldms 60 2000
tap-at 600 500
expect keyboard down
